  "视觉生成": "visual generation",
  "收藏夹里的全栈教程越攒越多，我却还是不知道自己究竟会了什么。Stack Trail 是给我自己做的练习工具：不记看完几章，只看选题、方案、Demo 和发布有没有留下东西。": "There are more and more full-stack tutorials in my favorites, but I still don’t know what I know. Stack Trail is a practice tool for myself: I don’t remember how many chapters I have read, but only whether there is anything left in the topic selection, plan, demo, and release.",
