  "四个角色可以说话不一样，但报告结构和质量底线完全一致。": "The four roles may speak differently, but the reporting structure and quality bottom line are exactly the same.",
  "它不会回答未来一定怎样，也不替代心理、医疗、法律或金融建议。正式发布前仍要人工检查，用户也不该输入能识别自己的隐私。": "It does not answer questions about what the future must hold, nor does it replace psychological, medical, legal, or financial advice. Manual inspection is still required before official release, and users should not enter personal information that can identify them.",
  "它就是一款本地编辑器：没有账号、云同步、多人协作或知识库。macOS 包还没做 Apple 公证，首次打开需要手动允许。": "It's just a local editor: no accounts, cloud sync, multi-person collaboration, or knowledge base. The macOS package has not been notarized by Apple, and you need to manually allow it when opening it for the first time.",
  "它目前只服务我一个人，外部用户验证还很少。功能做得多，不等于这就是一门成立的生意——这点我刻意留在页面上。": "It currently only serves me, and there is very little external user verification. Having many functions does not mean that it is an established business - I deliberately left this point on the page.",
  "它是一件认真做过很多轮的本地工具，但没有团队调度和协作能力，我也不打算把它包装成平台。": "It is a local tool that has been carefully developed for many rounds, but it does not have team scheduling and collaboration capabilities, and I do not plan to package it as a platform.",
  "它源于一个很具体的担心：闹钟本来只想在耳机里响，耳机一断，却可能突然外放。为了守住“不吵到别人”这句话，我处理了精确调度、后台唤醒、耳机断连和不同 Android 版本的脾气。": "It stems from a very specific worry: the alarm clock originally only wanted to sound in the earphones, but when the earphones are disconnected, it may suddenly sound outside. In order to keep the saying \"don't disturb others\", I dealt with precise scheduling, background wake-up, headset disconnection and the temper of different Android versions.",
  "提交材料 · 上传文件、粘贴文本与目标 JD": "Submit materials · Upload files, paste text and target JD",
  "提问 · 选择生活指引或具体问题": "Ask a question · Select life guidance or specific questions",
  "同一个人跨渠道出现，也不能凭“看起来像”就合并；关联要有证据，还得能撤销。": "If the same person appears across channels, they cannot be merged just because they \"look alike\"; the association must have evidence and must be able to be revoked.",
  "统筹产品线规划、复杂方案设计与约 14 人团队，围绕客户、竞企、市场、产品四类洞察持续迭代。接手后优先清理存量数据质量问题，再推进对话式 AI 场景封装与一线业务专项。": "Coordinates product line planning, complex solution design, and a team of approximately 14 people to continuously iterate around four types of insights: customers, competitors, markets, and products. After taking over, priority will be given to cleaning up existing data quality issues, and then promoting conversational AI scenario encapsulation and front-line business projects.",
  "统筹商情洞察与产品库两条产品线，负责路线、团队、营收与续约；管理约 14 人团队。": "Coordinate the two product lines of business insights and product library, responsible for routes, teams, revenue and contract renewals; manage a team of approximately 14 people.",
