  "小红书改编": "Adapted from Little Red Book",
  "写 AI 产品、数据产品、职场和业务判断。很多文章都来自一次真实项目之后，我想把当时为什么那样选讲清楚。": "Write about AI products, data products, workplace and business judgments. Many of the articles come from a real project, and I want to make it clear why I chose them that way.",
  "写到几十万字以后，真正难的不是下一句，而是谁知道了什么、哪条伏笔还没还。Agent 负责记账，我负责写人。": "After writing hundreds of thousands of words, the real difficulty is not the next sentence, but who knows what and which foreshadowing has not yet been paid. The agent is responsible for accounting and I am responsible for writing.",
  "心镜解读 · 实际生成的牌面结果与行动提示": "Heart Mirror Interpretation · Actual generated card results and action tips",
