  "心镜拾光是一件不打算商业化的小程序作品。每日一牌、单牌与三牌、78 张完整牌组、分享图和本地历史都做了；最费心的反而是删掉那些像预言一样笃定的话，让解读停在“照见自己”这里。": "Heart Mirror Picking Up Light is a small program work that is not intended to be commercialized. Daily cards, single cards and three cards, 78 complete decks, sharing pictures and local history were all done; the most troublesome thing was to delete those words that were as certain as prophecies and let the interpretation stop at \"seeing yourself\".",
