  "信息怎么组织、用户下一步做什么、数据怎么算、失败时怎么退回来，这些需要一起设计。好看的演示只是起点。": "How to organize information, what users do next, how to calculate data, and how to return in case of failure, these need to be designed together. A good-looking presentation is just the starting point.",
