  "终端一多，名字和标签很快就失去意义。我想让人一眼知道谁在工作、卡在哪里，又不把桌面做成另一块企业仪表盘。": "When there are too many terminals, names and labels quickly lose their meaning. I wanted to let people know at a glance who was working and where they were stuck, without turning the desktop into another corporate dashboard.",
  "种子用户": "seed user",
  "主导 QingBI 从 0→1→商业化，并完成公测发布。": "Lead the commercialization of QingBI from 0→1→and complete the public beta release.",
  "主导产品从 0→1→商业化，设计并执行 MVP、内测、公测的递进式发布计划，完成约 30 家种子客户培养与公开发布；通过能力升级同步提升成交效率与整体客单价。": "From 0→1→commercialization of leading products, we designed and implemented a progressive release plan of MVP, internal testing, and public testing, and completed the cultivation and public release of about 30 seed customers; we simultaneously improved transaction efficiency and overall customer unit price through capability upgrades.",
  "主页只留闹钟和助眠声。权限与诊断很重要，但不值得每天挡在用户面前。": "The homepage only has alarm clocks and sleep aid sounds. Permissions and diagnostics are important, but not worth getting in front of users every day.",
  "状态增量": "status increment",
  "准时叫醒和绝不乱响都不能打折。只要系统无法确认声音会去耳机，这次闹钟就宁可安静。": "Waking up on time and never making any noise cannot be discounted. As long as the system can't confirm that the sound is going to the headphones, the alarm would rather be silent this time.",
